  LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$INFRA/asan/lib ./st_pristine 'm{asc=b{bnd=f,org=f},asc=b{bnd=f,org=f}}'  -> ret=0 + 'Direct leak of 104 byte(s) ... parser_yy.y:288' (+ indirect)
  LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$WORK/build/lib ./st_pristine 'm{asc=b{bnd=f,org=f},asc=b{bnd=f,org=f}}'   -> ret=0, no leak
